1
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:36,680
Prince Yu,

2
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,440
I unintentionally

3
00:01:38,759 --> 00:01:42,020
overheard a few words between you and Prince Shuo just now.

4
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:43,440
I am dull-witted.

5
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:45,770
I hope Your Highness can enlighten me.

6
00:01:48,039 --> 00:01:49,680
The matter Miss Tang is asking about

7
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,880
will, after all, damage my sixth brother's reputation.

8
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:53,240
As his older brother...

9
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,080
Prince Yu.

10
00:01:56,039 --> 00:01:57,560
Since Miss Tang trusts me,

11
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:00,320
I won't be afraid of him blaming me

12
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:02,000
and will just tell the truth.

13
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,770
Your Highness means

14
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:13,160
that woman

15
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,280
looks like me,

16
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,200
but was...

17
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,520
There are many people in Sixth Brother's mansion.

18
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,980
You just need to ask around

19
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,460
to know I'm telling the truth.

20
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:29,560
Miss Tang.

21
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,820
Greetings, Miss Tang.

22
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:34,640
This way.

23
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:35,520
Okay.

24
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,920
Miss Tang is back.

25
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:40,680
Miss Tang.

26
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:43,880
Take my advice.

27
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:46,600
My sixth brother has suffered since childhood,

28
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:47,880
so he tends to go to extremes.

29
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:50,160
Even if you want to save your own life,

30
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:52,280
you must never disobey him.

31
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,880
Your Highness means that

32
00:02:54,320 --> 00:02:55,560
if I cannot obediently

33
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,440
stay in Prince Shuo's Mansion,

34
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,120
my life will be in danger.

35
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:01,650
Learn from the mistakes

36
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,280
of those before you.

37
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:04,500
Never mind.

38
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,680
I can't help but admire

39
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,060
Miss Tang's excellent pipa playing.

40
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:12,720
If you ever need anything,

41
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,660
just send me a message.

42
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,800
I will meet your requests.

43
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:19,200
After all, I am his brother,

44
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,880
so I can always put in a good word for you.

45
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,180
Thank you, Your Highness.

46
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:34,700
It seems Prince Yu was telling the truth.

47
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,080
I need to plan ahead.

48
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,240
What's wrong?

49
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,890
Let's go. Stop looking.

50
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:04,720
The dignified Prince Shuo

51
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,650
is entangled with a mere musician.

52
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:08,840
Aren't you afraid of being laughed at if word gets out?

53
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:10,320
It's not what you think.

54
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:11,320
Let me explain.

55
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,680
Seeing is believing.

56
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:14,880
Tang Zhiluo.

57
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,920
Why can you be pleasant to everyone else

58
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:19,760
but refuse to listen to me?

59
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,840
I am the one you should trust the most.

60
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:22,160
Aren't I?

61
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,680
You've said enough, Your Highness.

62
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,120
May I say a few words?

63
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,840
These past few days, you've locked me in your mansion,

64
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:29,770
and I'm being watched everywhere.

65
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:33,620
I know you are deeply in love with that Miss Tang,

66
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,480
but she is gone forever.

67
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:38,360
Although I look somewhat like her,

68
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:40,240
we are not the same person.

69
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:42,280
Why force it?

70
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:44,480
You don't just look like her.

71
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,280
You are her.

72
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,480
I am not.

73
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,400
Prince Shuo.

74
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:55,159
Tang Zhiluo is just a lowly musician.

75
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,720
Even though my status is low,

76
00:06:58,360 --> 00:07:00,420
I will never let anyone trample on me.

77
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:02,850
Tang Zhiluo.

78
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,760
I'll say it one more time.

79
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,770
You are the one I'm looking for.

80
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:43,120
You're awake.

81
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:48,040
I'm sorry.

82
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,560
I failed to consider your feelings.

83
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,240
This is...

84
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,600
On your arm,

85
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:09,280
do you have an identical mark?

86
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:25,720
I can't believe there's such a coincidence in this world.

87
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,960
This is too unbelievable.

88
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,360
Let me think about it.

89
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,080
You're hurt.

90
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,559
I'm fine.

91
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,600
Then I'll go get a doctor.

92
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,400
It's fine.

93
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:46,220
As long as you don't leave,

94
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:48,640
anything is fine.

95
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:15,400
Are you satisfied with my medical skills, Your Highness?

96
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,770
Very satisfied.

97
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:53,240
Could predestined love from a past life be real?

98
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:54,440
No.

99
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:56,560
Even if it's a predestined marriage...

100
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:58,220
But I have to stay alive first.

101
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:01,080
Prince Shuo is unpredictable.

102
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,880
It's too dangerous to stay here.

103
00:10:03,880 --> 00:10:05,920
But how can I escape?

104
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,480
Fake my death to escape.

105
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:21,440
Prince Yu.
